{"title":"Build Our Machine","artist":"DAGames","date":"2026-07-29","sourceId":"ZFMg5irJJU8:041","sourceHash":"c424d05a759571250b0e91428f6f6126b59fba7343cf8a59056ec171e7bbe754","duration":240.9,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":10.36,"end":11.914,"text":"They have sent you a letter","translation":"그들은 네게 편지를 보냈어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":11.914,"end":13.56,"text":"To come back home to play","translation":"집으로 돌아와 놀라고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":13.56,"end":14.66,"text":"But to your dismay","translation":"하지만 네가 실망하게도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":14.66,"end":15.691,"text":"This isn't your day","translation":"오늘은 네 날이 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":15.82,"end":17.78,"text":"For the happy fun time has begun to fade","translation":"즐겁고 행복했던 시간은 이제 사라지기 시작했으니까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":17.78,"end":21.008,"text":"Watch as we reanimate our corpses you abandoned","translation":"네가 버려둔 우리 시체를 되살리는 걸 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":21.008,"end":22.769,"text":"We're dismantled, we're mishandled","translation":"우린 해체되고 함부로 다뤄졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":23.12,"end":24.99,"text":"But we won't be skipped and swayed","translation":"그래도 우린 무시당하고 휘둘리진 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":25.41,"end":26.651,"text":"Trapped within these walls","translation":"이 벽 안에 갇힌 채","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":26.77,"end":28.41,"text":"You left our souls to drip away","translation":"넌 우리 영혼이 흘러 사라지게 했어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":28.41,"end":30.131,"text":"The ink decays, the walls at bay","translation":"잉크는 썩고 벽은 막아 서지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":30.31,"end":32.09,"text":"But the reckoning has come today","translation":"오늘 심판이 찾아왔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":32.09,"end":32.681,"text":"You say","translation":"넌 말하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":32.99,"end":34.55,"text":"Boris has no guts","translation":"네가 기계 장치로 바꿔서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":34.55,"end":36.13,"text":"'cause you replaced it with mechanical strain","translation":"보리스는 내장이 없다고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":36.13,"end":37.871,"text":"We've been tortured but we move forward","translation":"우린 고문당했지만 앞으로 나아가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":37.91,"end":39.59,"text":"This disorder kills your day!","translation":"이 혼란이 네 하루를 죽여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":40.71,"end":44.772,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":44.88,"end":46.98,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":47.04,"end":51.48,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":51.48,"end":54.08,"text":"For now, you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":54.08,"end":57.2,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":60.48,"end":61.6,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":61.6,"end":64.6,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":65.93,"end":68.99,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":68.99,"end":70.17,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":74.5,"end":76.44,"text":"So, you found all the pieces to initiate the pain","translation":"그래 너는 고통을 시작할 모든 조각을 찾았어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":76.44,"end":78.292,"text":"Our venom stains, the night remains","translation":"우리 독은 얼룩지고 밤은 남아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":78.36,"end":80.44,"text":"But the ending is always just the same, no gain","translation":"하지만 끝은 늘 똑같아 아무것도 얻지 못해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":80.44,"end":82.34,"text":"Nod your head to the beat of death","translation":"죽음의 비트에 맞춰 고개를 끄덕여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":82.34,"end":84.16,"text":"As you draw your last eternal breath","translation":"마지막 영원의 숨을 내쉴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":84.16,"end":85.6,"text":"Sensations of an invasion","translation":"침입의 감각이","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":85.6,"end":87.48,"text":"start to course right through your veins","translation":"네 혈관을 타고 흐르기 시작해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":87.48,"end":89.4,"text":"You say we have no brains","translation":"넌 우리가 뇌가 없다고 말하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":89.4,"end":91.0,"text":"We're just cartoons for your portrayal","translation":"우린 네가 그려 내는 만화일 뿐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":91.0,"end":93.04,"text":"To tell some tale about a boat and sail","translation":"배와 돛에 관한 어떤 이야기를 들려주려고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":93.04,"end":95.22,"text":"But sure, this inevitably unveils the fail","translation":"하지만 그래 결국 이건 실패를 드러내","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":95.3,"end":97.25,"text":"Splashes of eternal hate will flood the floor","translation":"영원한 증오의 물보라가 바닥을 뒤덮고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":97.25,"end":98.8,"text":"and clean your slate","translation":"네 기록을 지워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":98.8,"end":100.64,"text":"Now, we're the tools and you're the fool","translation":"이제 우린 도구고 넌 바보야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":100.66,"end":102.56,"text":"Our nightmare dominates!","translation":"우리 악몽이 지배해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":103.56,"end":107.331,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":107.34,"end":109.778,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":109.86,"end":114.28,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":114.28,"end":116.84,"text":"For now, you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":116.84,"end":117.7,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":118.92,"end":122.6,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":122.6,"end":124.5,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":124.56,"end":129.08,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":129.08,"end":131.72,"text":"For now, you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":131.72,"end":134.92,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":136.22,"end":139.1,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":139.1,"end":142.18,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":143.61,"end":146.381,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":146.381,"end":147.3,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":147.3,"end":149.16,"text":"I am aware","translation":"난 알고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":149.16,"end":151.94,"text":"That your soul is now divine","translation":"이제 네 영혼은 신성해졌다는 걸","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":151.94,"end":154.76,"text":"We care to not toil with unbroken chains","translation":"우린 끊어지지 않는 사슬에 매여 고생하지 않으려 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":154.76,"end":156.8,"text":"So don't toil with ours","translation":"그러니 그가 우리 빛나는 별들에게 한 것처럼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":156.8,"end":159.42,"text":"like he did to our shining stars","translation":"우리에게도 그러지 마","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":161.26,"end":163.02,"text":"So prepare for adventure","translation":"그러니 모험을 준비해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":163.02,"end":167.14,"text":"We're a whole new creature from the darkest side","translation":"우린 가장 어두운 곳에서 온 완전히 새로운 존재야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":167.52,"end":169.66,"text":"You can't take away the pain we feel","translation":"넌 우리가 느끼는 고통을 빼앗을 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":169.66,"end":172.12,"text":"Created as monsters that come to life!","translation":"살아 움직이는 괴물로 만들어졌어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":172.12,"end":173.66,"text":"(Come back to life)","translation":"다시 살아나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":177.12,"end":178.22,"text":"So, you've come to the end now","translation":"그래 이제 너는 끝에 다다랐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":178.22,"end":179.56,"text":"Alive but dead inside","translation":"살아 있지만 속은 죽었지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":179.74,"end":180.5,"text":"The heart beats loud","translation":"심장은 크게 뛰고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":180.5,"end":181.64,"text":"You've joined our crowd","translation":"넌 우리 무리에 들어왔어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":181.64,"end":183.36,"text":"We are but punished serpentines","translation":"우린 벌받은 뱀들일 뿐이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":183.36,"end":185.28,"text":"Your life with him was fun","translation":"그와 함께한 네 삶은 즐거웠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":185.28,"end":187.46,"text":"But now the terror's only just begun","translation":"하지만 이제 공포는 막 시작됐어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":187.46,"end":189.26,"text":"Now come with me and you will see","translation":"이제 나와 함께 오면 보게 될 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":189.26,"end":190.76,"text":"We're a new-born cyanide!","translation":"우린 갓 태어난 독이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":192.28,"end":195.89,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":196.16,"end":198.33,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":198.33,"end":202.89,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":202.89,"end":205.443,"text":"For now you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":205.443,"end":206.43,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":206.43,"end":210.33,"text":"I am alive, immortalized","translation":"난 살아 있어 불멸이 되었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":210.33,"end":213.15,"text":"You're the creator, you traitor","translation":"넌 창조주이자 배신자야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":213.15,"end":217.699,"text":"Hey! There's no vaccine to cure our dirty needs","translation":"이봐 우리의 더러운 욕망을 고칠 백신은 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":217.699,"end":220.25,"text":"For now you must build up our machine","translation":"이제 너는 우리 기계를 만들어야 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":220.25,"end":224.89,"text":"You die tonight, tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":224.89,"end":227.544,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":227.77,"end":233.42,"text":"You die tonight, tonight!","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어 오늘 밤","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":233.42,"end":235.12,"text":"Build up our machine","translation":"우리 기계를 만들어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":235.12,"end":237.629,"text":"You die tonight","translation":"넌 오늘 밤 죽어","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}